    "detailed_description": "<i>Garcharius, the young dragon, is dead.</i><br><br>Tower of the Dragons is a story-driven, turn-based combat RPG. Join your companions and defeat monsters to uncover the secrets of the tower left behind by the dragon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686940/extras/709e073c52bb8ed7344a9be23fc5f749.avif?t=1721986919\" width=598 height=236 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suspicious tower and hidden treasures</h2>A tower has emerged after the mysterious death of a mighty dragon.<br>It is told that whoever conquers the tower will be rewarded with the invaluable treasure the dragon has left behind......<br>Is this a challenge or just a trap? What is the true purpose of this tower?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic battles with a variety of enemies</h2>Each battle has its own unique opponents. No repetitive battles.<br>Strategize your moves to defeat opponents efficiently!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chibi Characters</h2>Cute characters drawn in chibi art style await you!<br>(Enemies may not be cute)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beginner Support</h2>Have you ever wished to progress main scenario but stuck at a hard boss fight? Don't worry this time.<br>If you lose the same battle more than once, you'll be compensated with the best recovery item in the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Garcharius, the young dragon, is dead.</i><br><br>Tower of the Dragons is a story-driven, turn-based combat RPG. Join your companions and defeat monsters to uncover the secrets of the tower left behind by the dragon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686940/extras/709e073c52bb8ed7344a9be23fc5f749.avif?t=1721986919\" width=598 height=236 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suspicious tower and hidden treasures</h2>A tower has emerged after the mysterious death of a mighty dragon.<br>It is told that whoever conquers the tower will be rewarded with the invaluable treasure the dragon has left behind......<br>Is this a challenge or just a trap? What is the true purpose of this tower?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic battles with a variety of enemies</h2>Each battle has its own unique opponents. No repetitive battles.<br>Strategize your moves to defeat opponents efficiently!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chibi Characters</h2>Cute characters drawn in chibi art style await you!<br>(Enemies may not be cute)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beginner Support</h2>Have you ever wished to progress main scenario but stuck at a hard boss fight? Don't worry this time.<br>If you lose the same battle more than once, you'll be compensated with the best recovery item in the game.",
